<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1981</h1><p class="ref-lede">1981 in world history: 14 events, 4 births, 15 deaths, 2 states founded and 2 that came to an end. 199 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
